{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/109737","id":2753503294,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc6kHyA-","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/109737","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/109737.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/109737.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/109737","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/109737/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/109737/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/109737/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/77b89bf08b73ad5b4a17e5268d4565a39bb205ac","number":109737,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"Add directional lightmap specular light","user":{"login":"jcostello","id":1168582,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjExNjg1ODI=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1168582?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/jcostello","html_url":"https://github.com/jcostello","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jcostello/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jcostello/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jcostello/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jcostello/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jcostello/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jcostello/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jcostello/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jcostello/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jcostello/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"\r\nCloses https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/63016\r\n\r\nBased on @Calinou work on branch https://github.com/godotengine/godot/compare/master...Calinou:godot:lightmapgi-directional-draw-direct-specular-lobes and https://media.contentapi.ea.com/content/dam/eacom/frostbite/files/gdc2018-precomputedgiobalilluminationinfrostbite.pdf\r\n\r\nReal Time (This PR and Master)\r\n<img width=\"1500\" height=\"866\" alt=\"Screenshot from 2025-08-18 11-07-22\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/3149b043-ef1d-453d-a4a4-cb0bbe53a1ec\" />\r\n\r\nNo directional (This PR and Master)\r\n<img width=\"1500\" height=\"866\" alt=\"Screenshot from 2025-08-18 11-08-28\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/188be4af-e844-4593-b1a1-cc9af192b4cc\" />\r\n\r\nDirectional (Master)\r\n<img width=\"1500\" height=\"866\" alt=\"Screenshot from 2025-08-18 11-12-00\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/90f009de-b549-4941-9df9-41f5c927bd7a\" />\r\n\r\nDirectional (This PR)\r\n<img width=\"1500\" height=\"866\" alt=\"Screenshot from 2025-08-18 11-10-09\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/836c2dc5-1775-41c8-a109-cc39f8d028ca\" />\r\n\r\n\r\n- [x] Implement in Compatibility and Mobile\r\n- [x] Benchmark\r\n- [x] Function to compute only specular?\r\n\r\nI will appreciate feedback to improve this\r\n\r\nEdit for Function to compute specular:\r\nA lighter function doesn't seems to improve the performance\r\n\r\nEdit for Benchmark:\r\n\r\nMaster:\r\n```\r\nProject FPS: 352 (2.84 mspf)\r\nProject FPS: 352 (2.84 mspf)\r\nProject FPS: 350 (2.85 mspf)\r\nProject FPS: 351 (2.84 mspf)\r\nProject FPS: 352 (2.84 mspf)\r\nProject FPS: 352 (2.84 mspf)\r\nProject FPS: 352 (2.84 mspf)\r\n```\r\n\r\nThis PR:\r\n```\r\nProject FPS: 343 (2.91 mspf)\r\nProject FPS: 343 (2.91 mspf)\r\nProject FPS: 342 (2.92 mspf)\r\nProject FPS: 343 (2.91 mspf)\r\nProject FPS: 344 (2.90 mspf)\r\nProject FPS: 343 (2.91 mspf)\r\nProject FPS: 343 (2.91 mspf)\r\n```\r\n\r\n\r\n| No Specular | Specular |\r\n|--------|--------|\r\n| <img width=\"1458\" height=\"864\" alt=\"Screenshot from 2025-08-27 23-47-53\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/12e3d41a-eac0-4478-8025-6d202e0345a9\" /> |  <img width=\"1458\" height=\"864\" alt=\"Screenshot from 2025-08-27 23-47-50\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/e8f64e3b-e61e-4e0a-b79f-d7f5c0a86c9f\" />|\r\n|  <img width=\"1458\" height=\"864\" alt=\"Screenshot from 2025-08-27 23-48-11\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/656a9ed5-f288-47ab-93a4-003a8ff0d81e\" /> |  <img width=\"1458\" height=\"864\" alt=\"Screenshot from 2025-08-27 23-48-08\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/18010054-68a5-4d50-8c18-263656191b9f\" /> |\r\n|  <img width=\"1458\" height=\"864\" alt=\"Screenshot from 2025-08-27 23-48-53\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/57892af5-4af5-4ee7-bc37-0906ce70dd49\" /> | <img width=\"1458\" height=\"864\" alt=\"Screenshot from 2025-08-27 23-48-50\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/7b6fa9c0-97a4-4f4d-bf04-40b7912ea240\" /> |\r\n| <img width=\"1458\" height=\"864\" alt=\"Screenshot from 2025-08-27 23-49-14\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/38556e4a-ec59-4012-aa32-d3b508898000\" /> | <img width=\"1458\" height=\"864\" alt=\"Screenshot from 2025-08-27 23-49-08\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/f9002a1c-9857-475c-b582-73bfbaa63d4c\" /> |\r\n| <img width=\"1458\" height=\"864\" alt=\"Screenshot from 2025-08-27 23-58-12\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/3803e6bd-0bba-4cff-acd6-365dd787adc9\" /> | <img width=\"1458\" height=\"864\" alt=\"Screenshot from 2025-08-27 23-58-06\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/fc62f413-73e1-4f75-b82c-9ed8311ff212\" /> |\r\n| <img width=\"1458\" height=\"864\" alt=\"Screenshot from 2025-08-27 23-58-44\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/8b9955b7-8a36-436a-9dc8-151476d6c453\" /> | <img width=\"1458\" height=\"864\" alt=\"Screenshot from 2025-08-27 23-58-35\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/310ac88d-b19e-40bf-9d5e-5ede1e3e7618\" /> |\r\n| <img width=\"1458\" height=\"864\" alt=\"Screenshot from 2025-08-27 23-59-00\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/d45fd4e0-4106-4f75-b0c0-e240ecc27631\" /> | <img width=\"1458\" height=\"864\" alt=\"Screenshot from 2025-08-27 23-58-56\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/26ae3bac-f3ea-408e-8297-eb585306fb90\" /> |\r\n\r\n\r\n","labels":[{"id":73330066,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2Ng==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/enhancement","name":"enhancement","description":"","color":"aaccff","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279098111,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgxMTE=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:rendering","name":"topic:rendering","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":2666708289,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNjY2NzA4Mjg5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:3d","name":"topic:3d","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":{"id":15520464,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4A7NLQ","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/25","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/25","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/25/labels","number":25,"state":"open","title":"4.8","description":"","creator":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}